<title>UK: Refuge Group meeting further adjourned.</title>
<headline>Refuge Group meeting further adjourned.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Refuge Group Plc on Thursday said its extraordinary general meeting held today to approve the proposed merger with United Friendly Group Plc was further adjourned until October 16.</p>
<p>The meeting was originally convened on September 9, but adjourned until today.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
